    "body": "> Well, `info` is registered at https://www.iana.org/assignments/uri-schemes/uri-schemes.xhtml, though http://info-uri.info/ suggests it's somewhat obsolete? But also, `info` is not `doi`.\r\n\r\nRight, I think this is supposed to be a different generic mechanism basically `info:doi/...` but that's a different thing from what is asked here. ",
